  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><p>Vortioxetine is an antidepressant used to treat major depressive disorder and, according to some sources, anxiety. It is authorised in the European Union and is used as an approved medicine, though it also remains under investigation for other uses.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=&quot;https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q3563148&quot;>Wikidata Q3563148</a> and the WHO ATC classification and the EMA medicines list; not checked by a person.</small></p><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>vortioxetine</td></tr><tr><td>ATC codes:</td><td>N06AX26</td></tr><tr><td>DrugBank:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://go.drugbank.com/drugs/DB09068&quot;>DB09068</a></td></tr><tr><td>PubChem CID:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/71768094&quot;>71768094</a></td></tr><tr><td>ChEBI:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/searchId.do?chebiId=CHEBI:76016&quot;>76016</a></td></tr><tr><td>Wikidata:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q3563148&quot;>Q3563148</a></td></tr><tr><td>formula:</td><td>C18H23N2S+</td></tr><tr><td>molar mass:</td><td>299.456 g/mol (PubChem)</td></tr></table><h4>Metabolites</h4><table><tr><td><code>LuAA34443</code></td><td>Lu AA34443</td><td>328.4 g/mol (pubchem)</td></tr></table></body></html>"));
